Package: sv-burpsuite
Architecture: all
Depends: svent-core, default-jre, curl, ca-certificates, unzip, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Svent web tool: Burp Suite Community (downloader)
 Downloads Burp Suite Community Edition from PortSwigger on install and adds
 a desktop launcher. This package ships only the installer and launcher; the
 application itself is fetched from PortSwigger under their own license.
